---
// Section 03: Esperienze Professionali
import SectionPatternCanvas from "./SectionPatternCanvas.astro"
---

<section
  id="section-03"
  class="section-slide relative w-screen min-w-[100vw] h-full overflow-y-auto px-4 sm:px-8 md:px-12 lg:px-16 flex flex-col justify-start shrink-0 snap-start pt-24 sm:pt-28 pb-8"
>
  <SectionPatternCanvas theme="code" />
  <div class="w-full max-w-[1312px] mx-auto flex flex-col justify-start gap-6 relative z-10">
  <!-- Section Editorial Header (Figma 17:6808 & 17:6807) -->
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 border-b border-gray-200/80 dark:border-gray-800 pb-3">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-[6px] bg-[#FDF2F4] dark:bg-[#380A10] border border-[#FECDD3] dark:border-red-900 text-[#8B1E2D] dark:text-red-300 font-bold text-[11px] tracking-wide">
        03 // DOVE HO LAVORATO?
      </div>
      <span class="text-[#94A3B8] dark:text-gray-400 font-medium tracking-wider text-[11px] hidden sm:inline">
        WORK RECORD &amp; PRODUCTION HISTORY
      </span>
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-[32px] font-bold text-[#0F172A] dark:text-white tracking-[-0.02em] mt-1 m-0">
      Esperienze Lavorative &amp; Percorso Professionale
    </h2>
    <p class="text-[14px] sm:text-[15px] text-[#64748B] dark:text-gray-300 max-w-4xl m-0 leading-normal">
      Le collaborazioni e esperienze professionali fino ad oggi.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Experience Cards Grid (2x2 Grid) -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
    <!-- Card 1: Skill Factory -->
    <div class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-xs border border-gray-200/90 rounded-[10px] p-5 flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 shadow-2xs hover:border-[#9B1C2E]/50 transition-all group">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-[6px] bg-[#9B1C2E]/10 text-[#9B1C2E] text-[15px] flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
              SK
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-[16px] text-[#111827] group-hover:text-[#9B1C2E] transition-colors m-0">
                Skill Factory
              </h3>
              <p class="text-[12px] font-medium text-gray-700 m-0">
                Docente Unity &amp; C# · Back-end Developer
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-100 font-mono text-[10.5px] text-gray-600 font-medium whitespace-nowrap">
            Docenza / Dev
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-gray-500 mt-2 mb-2 flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>📅</span> 2025 - Presente (Luglio 2026)
        </div>

        <ul class="text-[12.5px] text-[#374151] space-y-1.5 pl-4 list-disc m-0 leading-relaxed">
          <li>Insegnamento pratico di Unity e programmazione orientata agli oggetti (OOP) in linguaggio C#.</li>
          <li>Sviluppo piattaforma web aziendale focalizzato sul Back-end tramite Java / Spring Boot + Thymeleaf.</li>
          <li>Monitoraggio continuo di progetti studenteschi, supporto tecnico e sessioni di code review.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-2 border-t border-gray-100">
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-red-50 text-red-900 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium">Unity</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-red-50 text-red-900 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium">C#</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-blue-50 text-blue-900 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium">Java</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-blue-50 text-blue-900 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium">Spring Boot</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 font-mono text-[11px]">Thymeleaf</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 font-mono text-[11px]">Didattica</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 font-mono text-[11px]">OOP</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 2: L'ABCD Edutainment -->
    <div class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-xs border border-gray-200/90 rounded-[10px] p-5 flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 shadow-2xs hover:border-[#9B1C2E]/50 transition-all group">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-[6px] bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-800 font-heading text-[15px] flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
              L'
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-[16px] text-[#111827] group-hover:text-[#9B1C2E] transition-colors m-0">
                L'ABCD Edutainment
              </h3>
              <p class="text-[12px] font-medium text-gray-700 m-0">
                Sviluppatore VR / Unity &amp; MR-HMI
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-amber-50 font-mono text-[10.5px] text-amber-800 font-medium whitespace-nowrap">
            Tirocinio Extracurriculare
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-gray-500 mt-2 mb-2 flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>📅</span> 2024 - 2025 (Gennaio - Aprile 2026)
        </div>

        <ul class="text-[12.5px] text-[#374151] space-y-1.5 pl-4 list-disc m-0 leading-relaxed">
          <li>Collaborazione alla ricerca e sviluppo di progetti didattici per la piattaforma MR zSpace e MR-HMI.</li>
          <li>Sviluppo in C# dei sistemi e wrapper multi SDK per l'interazione spaziale 3D.</li>
          <li>Concept grafico (Figma-Canva) e implementazione UI &amp; UX interattiva tramite uGUI.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-2 border-t border-gray-100">
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-purple-50 text-purple-900 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium">Mixed Reality</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-purple-50 text-purple-900 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium">zSpace</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 font-mono text-[11px]">Multi SDK</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-red-50 text-red-900 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium">C#</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 font-mono text-[11px]">uGUI</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 font-mono text-[11px]">MR-HMI</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-900 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium">R&amp;D</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 3: Protom Group -->
    <div class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-xs border border-gray-200/90 rounded-[10px] p-5 flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 shadow-2xs hover:border-[#9B1C2E]/50 transition-all group">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <img src="/assets/figma/edu-protom-logo.png" alt="Protom Group" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-[6px] object-contain border border-gray-100 p-1 bg-white" />
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-[16px] text-[#111827] group-hover:text-[#9B1C2E] transition-colors m-0">
                Protom Group
              </h3>
              <p class="text-[12px] font-medium text-gray-700 m-0">
                Programmatore Unity &amp; XR · Front-end Developer
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-blue-50 font-mono text-[10.5px] text-blue-800 font-medium whitespace-nowrap">
            Somministrazione
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-gray-500 mt-2 mb-2 flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>📅</span> 2023 - 2024 (Novembre 2025)
        </div>

        <ul class="text-[12.5px] text-[#374151] space-y-1.5 pl-4 list-disc m-0 leading-relaxed">
          <li>Co-sviluppo piattaforma web focalizzato sul Front-end tramite HTML5, CSS3 e JavaScript.</li>
          <li>Prototipazione e programmazione moduli interattivi Unity &amp; XR per clienti enterprise.</li>
          <li>Integrazione pipeline asset grafici e ottimizzazione del rendering real-time.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-2 border-t border-gray-100">
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-blue-50 text-blue-900 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium">Front-end</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 font-mono text-[11px]">HTML5</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 font-mono text-[11px]">CSS3</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 font-mono text-[11px]">JavaScript</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-red-50 text-red-900 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium">Unity XR</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 font-mono text-[11px]">Enterprise</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 4: Katabasi Studio -->
    <div class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-xs border border-gray-200/90 rounded-[10px] p-5 flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 shadow-2xs hover:border-[#9B1C2E]/50 transition-all group">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 border-b border-gray-100 pb-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <img src="/assets/figma/exp-katabasi-logo.png" alt="Katabasi Studio" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-[6px] object-contain border border-gray-100 p-0.5 bg-white" />
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-[16px] text-[#111827] group-hover:text-[#9B1C2E] transition-colors m-0">
                Katabasi Studio
              </h3>
              <p class="text-[12px] font-medium text-gray-700 m-0">
                Unity &amp; Gameplay Programmer
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-emerald-50 font-mono text-[10.5px] text-emerald-800 font-medium whitespace-nowrap">
            Tirocinio · 720+ Ore
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-gray-500 mt-2 mb-2 flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>📅</span> Nov 2024 - Apr 2025
        </div>

        <ul class="text-[12.5px] text-[#374151] space-y-1.5 pl-4 list-disc m-0 leading-relaxed">
          <li>Durante i 5 mesi di stage (oltre 720 ore) ho collaborato attivamente allo sviluppo di due prodotti B2B realizzati in Unity e distribuiti su WebGL.</li>
          <li>Architettura software in C#, integrazione UI (uGUI), gestione localizzazione e Custom Editor Tools per ottimizzare il workflow.</li>
          <li>Testing, profilazione performance e packaging build WebGL cross-browser.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-2 border-t border-gray-100">
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-red-50 text-red-900 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium">Unity</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-red-50 text-red-900 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium">C#</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-purple-50 text-purple-900 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium">WebGL</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 font-mono text-[11px]">B2B Solutions</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 font-mono text-[11px]">Custom Editor Tools</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 font-mono text-[11px]">Localization</span>
        <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-[4px] bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-900 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium">720+ Ore</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>
